# Citation File Format — GitHub “Cite this repository.”

cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Formalization of Scott's Measurement Structures and Linear Inequalities in Lean 4"
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ericson
    given-names: Lars Warren
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, d/b/a Catskills Research Company"
    email: "lars.ericson@catskillsresearch.com"
